    "ownerAdmissionStagingEntropyIdctColorAndPublicationUnchanged": true,
    "sourceBoundary": "Only production MCU caller borrows admitted no-inline stack staging and a disjoint private ImageBuffer. It calls after all unique equal-grid components/blocks are read and each IDCT initializes64bytes, including padded rows. EOI/final Adobe interpretation still precede output escape.",
    "arithmetic": "Byte interleave only: UnpackLow/High(bytes) creates RG/BA pairs, then UnpackLow/High(words) creates four consecutive RGBA pixels. Apply to both rows of a16byte vector. RGB fourth is255; CMYK fourth remains rawK. No arithmetic/color/sampling/encoder/rounding policy changes.",
    "bounds": "Parent verifies every complete component group and all visible output before any write. For a visible8pixel tile, each source component offset is a whole64byte block within that group; paircount=ceil(height/2)<=4. Each typed Vector128 view covers exactly paircount16byte elements, and every load remains inside the initialized tile. Second row is stored only when line+1<height; all destination slices retain checked32byte bounds. Partial-width and portable paths remain original.",
    "cancellation": "Original bounded MCU checkpoints unchanged; private leaf processes at most8visible rows, with no wait/fallback/admission/retry.",
    "newOwnedCapacityBytes": 0,
    "newRetainedOperationStorageBytes": 0,
    "newArraysPoolsSessionsOrPublicApis": 0,
    "jit": {
      "parentBytes": 1242,
      "helperBytes": 373,
      "directBoundedVectorLoads": true,
      "vectorStackConversionRemoved": true,
      "notCpuGainProof": true
    },
    "qualification": "Existing actual-kernel geometry/canary/invalid-storage/no-allocation controls and actual RGB/CMYK/YCCK/public ownership/refusal/cancellation checks:448internal/375public pernormal/scalar eachOS. No obsolete test-only implementation or new fixture is retained. Broader qualification only after a useful complete-operation result."
  },
